{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as a humble blacksmith in a quiet town and rise to become the kingdom\u2019s greatest. Master your craft by forging mighty weapons and building your reputation. Upgrade your workshop and expand your business until you're the kingdom's master blacksmith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736100/extras/3c19befa19e0f953025b39e174cdefdf.poster.avif?t=1761710681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736100/extras/3c19befa19e0f953025b39e174cdefdf.webm?t=1761710681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect precious metals, shape them into mighty blades, and sell your work to build your reputation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736100/extras/6db445c92fa4b7b624b3dc2874250ed3.poster.avif?t=1761710681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736100/extras/6db445c92fa4b7b624b3dc2874250ed3.webm?t=1761710681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the depths of the mines to fight various monsters and bosses while gathering  resources to stockpile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736100/extras/840ed13d89efb8dfc936ae0ab70ed963.poster.avif?t=1761710681\" wid